id: pm-csv-u254
title: Resume reader comment falsely permits empty map on list-all failure
description: "CodeRabbit exact-head review of PR 73 found that loadAppliedByTransaction documentation says an ordinary nonzero pm list-all result falls through to a best-effort empty map, while the corrected implementation throws CommandError. The stale comment teaches a data-duplicating behavior: an empty applied-row map can make resume re-import rows that already exist."
